# --- Claude Code ---
# Keep .claude/ (skills, commands, project settings, CLAUDE.md, memory) tracked
# so the whole team shares the same tooling and AI collaboration memory is
# restorable on a new machine (see docs/AI_CEO_WORKING_MODEL.md §6).
# Only per-user overrides stay ignored — settings.local.json holds personal
# permission overrides that shouldn't be forced on teammates.
.claude/settings.local.json
